{"articleNo":"1495","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1495&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"취업역량강화주간 프로그램 참가자 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.11.19","hit":"10024","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 30pt\">취업역량강화주간 프로그램 참가자 모집 안내</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -93.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -93.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">◈ 목적</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -28.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">취업준비생들이 취업에 대한 기본적인 소양을 배우고 특히, 최신 취업 트랜드를 습득함으로써 취업목표를 설정</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">하여 원활한 취업 준비가 되도록 함</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -93.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">전문적인 실전 취업 스킬 등의 교육으로 취업준비생들의 취업에 대한 자신감 고취</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -93.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">◈</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> 운영계획</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -93.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 교육일시 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2010. 11. 22.(월) ~ 11. 26.(금)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">[5일/12시간 과정]</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -93.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2 .교육인원 : 각 강좌 당 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">센터 참여 재학생 및 참여학사조직의 졸업생</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 30명(총 120명)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -93.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 모집방법 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">순위별 선착순 모집(1순위 - </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">학부 4학년과 대학원 2학년, 2순위 - 고학년)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -81.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 81.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 신청방법 : 센터 행정실 방문 후 신청명단 작성(공동실험실습관 401호)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -93.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGH